{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you can experience:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather resources and build traps:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely. Scour the room for materials to collect and use them to reinforce your defenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953510/extras/c0e50f591a71533431b2a4a19ef724fc.poster.avif?t=1770362810\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953510/extras/c0e50f591a71533431b2a4a19ef724fc.webm?t=1770362810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the fight directly:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a Pioneer and engage in combat yourself, even synergizing with your own defense line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953510/extras/3c0caa79f0f90fbf5bb1fa25178c17c9.poster.avif?t=1770362810\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953510/extras/3c0caa79f0f90fbf5bb1fa25178c17c9.webm?t=1770362810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a unique battle line:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defensive installation can alter enemy paths. Use them strategically to construct your distinctive front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953510/extras/18516656b3b24206956034089b976f96.poster.